[h2]Unflip[/h2]
Stand next to an overturned land vehicle and hold [b]Unflip[/b] until it is upright. A quad bike takes about three seconds at default settings and a heavy vehicle takes up to eight. The vehicle has brief damage protection while it lands.

The server can set the action's reach, the tilt and speed at which a vehicle qualifies, both hold times and the vehicle weights that define them, and the duration of damage protection. It can also enable automatic recovery for AI vehicles and set how long to wait before righting them.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Unflip[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Unflip[/b], check [b]Enable Unflip[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

